 mission holds its annual Veterans Day parade through downtown Mobile. Loca
 l organizations bring floats\, marching units\, bands\, flag details and m
 ilitary equipment. The route runs west on Canal\, north on Broad\, east on
  Government and south on Claiborne. Find a spot along the route early.\n\n
 Price: No published price\n\nDetails: https://coastaleventures.com/events/
 ev-mobile-veterans-day-parade-1111.html
