DESCRIPTION:Saturday 11/14 · 10:00 AM to 2:00 PM\n\nSanta Rosa County host
 s Rural Roots Day to celebrate local farming. The day includes a farmer pa
 nel\, live animals\, a hay maze\, a planting station\, crafts and a Kid's 
 Corner. Food and activities are complimentary\, and a Fall Heritage Pie Co
 ntest takes entries until 10:30 AM.\n\nPrice: Free\n\nDetails: https://coa
 staleventures.com/events/ev-rural-roots-day-jay-1114.html
