 e's Spirit of the Season parade steps off at 1 PM from the Navarre Library
 \, runs south on Presidio Street\, turns left on Esplanade Street and ends
  in the back lot of Centennial Bank. Santa and Mrs. Claus arrive by fire t
 ruck and take free photos with children in Navarre Park afterward\, with f
 ree baked goods at Mrs. Claus' Bakery and a Merry Market of local artists 
