 ach\, FL 32547
DESCRIPTION:8:00 AM to 1:00 PM\n\nThe Downtown FWB Saturday Market sets up 
 at Fort Walton Beach Landing Park on the waterfront from 8 AM to 1 PM\, fr
 ee to browse for the whole family. Local artisans\, produce growers\, and 
 other vendors fill the park on the second and fourth Saturday of every mon
 th\, year-round. Walking the market alongside the water is as much the poi
 nt as the shopping.\n\nPrice: Free\n\nDetails: https://coastaleventures.co
 m/events/ev-downtown-fwb-saturday-market-0912.html
